# {name}

An Ipê application scaffolded by `ipe init`. `src/Main.ipe` is a small
[`Ipe.Web`](https://ipe-lang.org) counter — a Model holding a count, `Increment`
and `Decrement` messages, and a two-button view — that serves its UI over HTTP.

Run it:

```sh
ipe run
```

Then open http://localhost:8000 in a browser and click the buttons.
